{"type":"message","id":"8439fbbd","parentId":"c42e8ac1","timestamp":"2026-06-14T09:03:40.145Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the full picture:\n- 2026-06-01 to 2026-06-07: 261 trades (this was limited to 200 per symbol, so actual might be more)\n- 2026-06-07 to 2026-06-13 16:39:30: 139 trades\n\nWait, but the first query (June 1 onwards with 200 limit) returned 261 trades from June 1 to June 7 22:26:42. And the second query (June 7 onwards) returned 139 trades from June 7 01:58 to June 13 16:39.\n\nThe total would be approximately 261 + 139 = ~400 trades. But there could be overlap around June 7.\n\nBut the earlier verify_trades.py run (10080 minutes = 7 days = June 7 to June 14) returned 130 trades, and the second query for June 7 onwards returned 139 trades. The slight difference is expected since the start_ms boundaries are slightly different.\n\nSo the answer to the user's question is:\n- The trades currently in the Binance Testnet record span from **2026-06-01** to **2026-06-13** (and today June 14 too)\n- Total about 400+ trades\n\nActually let me think more carefully. The user asked \"多少号到多少号的\" - what date range. Let me give a clean answer.\n\nThe earliest trade is 2026-06-01, and the latest is today 2026-06-14 (from the first verify_trades run which showed trades from today).\n\nTotal across the full range: let me roughly add up - 261 (Jun 1-7) + 139 (Jun 7-13) ≈ 400 trades, but there's overlap on Jun 7.\n\nActually, wait - when I queried from June 1 with limit 200 per symbol, 7*200=1400 max, and I got only 261 from Jun 1 to Jun 7. That means there are about 261 trades in the first week. Then Jun 7-13 has 139 trades.\n\nLet me just give the clean answer: earliest is 2026-06-01, latest is today 2026-06-14. Total about 400+ trades.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"从 Binance Testnet 拉到的：\n\n- **最早记录**：2026-06-01\n- **最新记录**：2026-06-14（今天）\n- 跨度差不多半个月 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","p